type: txt
help: This limits the number of CPU resources the container can use
			(default: 0)
val_help: u32:0; Unlimited
val_help: txt; Amount of CPU time the container can use in amount of cores (up to three decimals)
syntax:expression: exec "${vyos_libexec_dir}/validate-value --regex \'(0|[1-9]\\d*)(\\.\\d{1,3})?\'   --value \'$VAR(@)\'"; "Container CPU limit must be a (decimal) number in range 0 to number of threads"
